    - target: {fileID: 5636964651628623906, guid: 30cc608f61128e64ea18f6fbbd32e5c1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'V1: Rosette? I am sorry.

        V2: What?

        V1: You know, I- for being difficult sometimes. You know, I have my opinions, and-

        V2: And I love you for them. You could be a bit more money-oriented though, hehe! Can''t always uphold higher morals on an empty stomach, you know?

        V1: Mhm. Still, we can.. I''m sure together we can come up with something more brilliant. Safer.

        V2: ..yeah, eventually. Eventually, we will.

        V2: Shut up, jerk, we weren''t that loud! Mind your business, watch your shitty, uh-

        V2: Fine-fine, I''ll get quiet. Don''t fret, Rota.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
