    - target: {fileID: 5636964651628623906, guid: 30cc608f61128e64ea18f6fbbd32e5c1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'V1:  What''s with the backpack? I thought we are here to rest and relax before the working week? Are you going hiking or something?

        V2: H-ha, no, of course not, you know me. Bugs.

        V2: It''s something I wanted you to sign-

        V1: You again with it! I told you-

        V2: We''ve went over it again, you''ll like this one better, they promese-

        V1: No! How- how dare you even.

        V2: Well, I signed it already, so!- Just wanted to share!

        V2: Don''t be like this..

        V2: Come on, girl, you know I love you, but-

        V2: Don''t leave!-

        V2: ..We already paid for the tickets...'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
